OL,3,GNEWSAMan charged after teenager raped  
OL,4,Ain city park                           
OL,6,FA 19-year-old man has been charged     
OL,7,Fafter a teenage girl was raped in a    
OL,8,Fpark, police have said.                
OL,10,FBangally Gumanneh is accused of one    
OL,11,Fcount of rape and one of sexual assault
OL,12,Fafter Avon and Somerset Police were    
OL,13,Fcalled to Parade Gardens at about 23:30
OL,14,FGMT on 11 November.                    
OL,16,FGumanneh, of Odd Down, was re-arrested 
OL,17,Fon Thursday while on conditional bail. 
OL,18,FThe defendant appeared at Bristol      
OL,19,FMagistrates' Court earlier and was     
OL,20,Fremanded in custody.                   
OL,23,APub: 20-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
